  "id": "competitive-state-anxiety-inventory",
  "term": "Competitive State Anxiety Inventory",
  "definition": "Competitive State Anxiety Inventory is a questionnaire used in sport psychology to assess an athlete’s anxiety as a temporary state around competition. In this context, it is used to examine the mental and physical sides of anxiety before events, along with self-confidence.",
